    <briefdescription>
<para>This cast trait provides casting for the specific case of casting to a value-typed object from a pointer-typed object. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Note that <computeroutput>To</computeroutput> must be nullable/constructible from a pointer to <computeroutput>From</computeroutput> to use this cast. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
